// Plan (real terms) by financial year and plan source: the plan the model sums and the same plan in 2025-26 prices. The
// phased plan (derived) is not read here. Expected values: dw.fact_plan summed on the same keys, without the rows that are
// part of another measure, times (index of 2025-26) / (index of the year).
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year],
    'Plan Source'[Plan Source Code],
    "plan", [Plan],
    "plan_real", [Plan (real terms)]
)
ORDER BY 'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year], 'Plan Source'[Plan Source Code]
